# Day-of-month label noun: "двадцатого числа" names the twentieth day of the
# month, the genitive of "число" in its calendar sense.  Bound only after a
# spelled day ordinal (WORDORD), so "три числа" ("three numbers") stays a
# count.  Source: Wiktionary, s.v. число, sense 3, "день календарного
# месяца" (https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/число).
числа
